      "Stand up straight. Hold that sword like you mean it.",
      "The yard is yours when you want it. The monsters in the Reach are for after."
    ],
    "talk": [
      {
        "label": "Tell me about fighting.",
        "lines": [
          "One level for everything. You earn points as you climb and spend them in the skill tree, press K. Swords, bows, staves, shields: any of them can carry you the whole way.",
          "A shield in your off hand opens the Defense tree and takes a flat slice off every blow. Wear one even if you fight from a distance."
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Can I hire a sword?",
        "lines": [
          "Not yet. Contracts for sellswords, archers, and hedge mages are being drawn up. Come back when the clerks are done arguing."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "services": [
      {
        "kind": "quests"
      }
    ]
  },
