      {
        "label": "What do you grow here?",
        "lines": [
          "Barley, mostly, and a little flax. The hay goes to the quarry mules. Bread for the city comes from my oven, and you can buy it at the general store, so you need not pay my prices."
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Any trouble out here?",
        "lines": [
          "Moss imps in the hedge, now and then. The goblins up by the pines keep to themselves, which is more than I can say for their pine nuts. I find them in the hen house."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "services": []
  },
  {
